# The portable Vite application needs no credentials or .env file.
# Never put secrets in VITE_*, NEXT_PUBLIC_*, public/ or application source.
# GitHub Actions uses its temporary GITHUB_TOKEN; do not copy a PAT here.
# The existing news service is DISABLED. If separately configured in future,
# NEWS_SIGNING_JWK belongs only in that server/job's secret store.
# No news signing key or activation is required for local learning/development.
